Package: sensewls
Title: Sensitivity Analysis for Weighted Least Squares Estimators to Omitted Variables
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Leonard", "Wainstein", email = "lwainstein@reed.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
	person("Wolfgang", "Brightenburg", email = "wbrigh@uw.edu", role = c("ctb"))
     )
Description: This package implements the sensitivity analysis tools, described in Wainstein and Hazlett (2026), for weighted least squares estimators of treatment effects to omitted variables.
